{"seq":2,"slug":"differential-privacy-synthesis","title":"差分隐私合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/differential-privacy-synthesis","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"差分隐私合成\">差分隐私合成</h1><p>「这份合成数据不会泄露任何真实个人」——这句话如果只是口头承诺，没有任何意义；攻击者不在乎你的诚意。差分隐私（differential privacy, DP）的价值，在于把这句承诺变成一条可以数学证明的保证：无论攻击者掌握多少背景知识、用多强的攻击，单个个体是否在训练集里，对最终输出的影响都被一个可调参数严格限制住。在 <a href=\"../foundations/fidelity-privacy-tradeoff\">保真度与隐私的权衡</a> 里，我们把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 称为权衡前沿的「调节钮」；这一篇把这个钮拧开，讲清它的定义、两条主流实现路线，以及如何在表格合成上落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>差分隐私合成，指在训练或测量过程中注入经过标定的随机性，使最终生成的合成数据满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon, \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私的形式保证。它与启发式脱敏的根本差别，在于安全性由数学定义支撑而非经验直觉：无论攻击者掌握多少背景知识，单个个体是否在训练集里，对输出的影响都被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ε</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 严格框住。</p>\n<p>要把它当工程工具用，必须记住两条形式性质——它们是 DP 合成相比传统脱敏的优势所在，也是整条管线可核算、可共享的前提。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>性质</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>工程含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>组合性</td>\n<td>多个 DP 机制串联，预算累加</td>\n<td>可为整条管线核算总预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>后处理免疫</td>\n<td>对 DP 输出做任何不碰原始数据的加工，保证不退化</td>\n<td>合成数据可无限次分析、共享，不再消耗预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可调参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>越小隐私越强，噪声越多</td>\n<td>权衡由合同级的数值旋钮控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这两条性质把抽象的「不泄露个体」变成可写进合同、可审计的量。下面的小节依次展开：形式定义 → 两条实现路线（训练时加噪与边际法）→ 预算如何选。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差分隐私的形式定义\">差分隐私的形式定义</h2><p>差分隐私约束的是一个随机机制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 对「相邻数据集」的行为。两个数据集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 称为相邻，如果它们只差一条记录（一个个体）。机制 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>ε</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\varepsilon, \\delta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>-差分隐私，当对任意相邻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D, D&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和任意输出集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ε</mi></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>D</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Pr[M(D) \\in S] \\le e^{\\varepsilon} \\cdot \\Pr[M(D&#x27;) \\in S] + \\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>直觉是：加进或拿掉任何一个人，输出分布几乎不变（被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>ε</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e^{\\varepsilon}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ε</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 因子框住），所以攻击者无法通过观察输出反推某个人是否在数据里。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 是隐私预算，越小隐私越强；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是允许保证失效的极小概率。</p>\n<p>DP 有两条工程上极重要的性质。一是<strong>组合性</strong>：多个 DP 机制串联，隐私预算累加，这让我们能为整条管线核算总预算。二是<strong>后处理免疫</strong>：对 DP 输出做任何不碰原始数据的加工，隐私保证不退化——这意味着只要合成过程满足 DP，生成的数据可以无限次分析、共享而不再消耗预算。这条性质是 DP 合成数据相比传统脱敏的根本优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条实现路线\">两条实现路线</h2><p>把 DP 注入表格合成，工业界主要走两条路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路线</th>\n<th>代表方法</th>\n<th>加噪位置</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>训练时加噪</td>\n<td>DP-SGD、DP-CTGAN</td>\n<td>梯度</td>\n<td>深度生成模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边际法</td>\n<td>PrivBayes、MST、AIM</td>\n<td>统计量(边际)</td>\n<td>低维强相关表格</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第一条是把差分隐私塞进深度生成模型的训练。核心工具是 DP-SGD：在每步梯度下降时，先裁剪每个样本的梯度范数限制其敏感度，再加入标定好的高斯噪声。把它套到 <a href=\"../methods/generative-models\">生成模型</a> 里的 GAN 就得到 DP-CTGAN，套到自回归模型就得到 DP 版的 TabularARGN。优点是通用、能处理高维复杂数据；缺点是噪声直接打在梯度上，对保真度伤害大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 小时质量下降明显。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边际法-表格上的隐形冠军\">边际法：表格上的隐形冠军</h2><p>第二条路线在表格基准上常常打败深度方法，是 2025 年 DP 表格合成评测里反复夺冠的一类。它不训练神经网络，而是先测量数据的低阶统计量——主要是一维、二维边际分布（即各列及列对的频率表），在这些统计量上加 DP 噪声，再用一个概率模型（如概率图模型）拟合带噪边际，最后从模型采样生成数据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[真实表格] --&gt; B[选择关键边际&lt;br/&gt;1维/2维频率]&#10;    B --&gt; C[测量边际统计量]&#10;    C --&gt; D[加 DP 噪声&lt;br/&gt;消耗 epsilon]&#10;    D --&gt; E[拟合图模型&lt;br/&gt;匹配带噪边际]&#10;    E --&gt; F[从模型采样]&#10;    F --&gt; G[DP 合成表格]&#10;    G --&gt; H[后处理免疫:&lt;br/&gt;可自由分析]\">flowchart TD\n    A[真实表格] --&gt; B[选择关键边际&lt;br/&gt;1维/2维频率]\n    B --&gt; C[测量边际统计量]\n    C --&gt; D[加 DP 噪声&lt;br/&gt;消耗 epsilon]\n    D --&gt; E[拟合图模型&lt;br/&gt;匹配带噪边际]\n    E --&gt; F[从模型采样]\n    F --&gt; G[DP 合成表格]\n    G --&gt; H[后处理免疫:&lt;br/&gt;可自由分析]</pre><p>PrivBayes 用差分隐私贝叶斯网络编码列间依赖，MST 选最大生成树上的二维边际，AIM 则用自适应迭代逐步挑选最有信息量的边际来花预算。它们之所以高效，是因为把宝贵的隐私预算集中花在少数关键统计量上，而非分散到每个梯度。代价是当列间相关是高阶、复杂的非线性关系时，低阶边际抓不全。这呼应了 <a href=\"../foundations/data-types-spectrum\">类型与谱系</a> 里提到的：边际法与基于统计的规则方法同源，区别只在于这里的统计量是带 DP 噪声从真实数据测出的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"隐私预算怎么选\">隐私预算怎么选</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值没有放之四海的标准，但有粗略的行业直觉：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon \\le 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 视为强隐私，常用于公开发布；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 在 1 到 10 之间是常见的实用区间；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon &gt; 10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 则隐私保证已相当弱。2026 年的一个趋势是用贝叶斯优化自动搜索 DP 合成的超参与预算分配，在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 下把保真度榨到最高，用调和平均之类的目标平衡多个评估维度。</p>\n<p>必须强调一个常见误区：DP 给的是「形式保证」，不等于「实测无泄露」，反之亦然。一个声称满足 DP 的实现可能因为代码 bug 而实际泄露，一个没有 DP 标签的方法也可能经验上很安全。因此 DP 保证必须与实证攻击审计配合使用——这正是 <a href=\"evaluation-fidelity-utility\">评估保真与效用</a> 里成员推断攻击要做的事。证明与实测，两条腿走路才稳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>差分隐私把「不泄露个体」从口头承诺变成由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 参数控制、可数学证明的保证。</li>\n<li>组合性让管线能核算总预算，后处理免疫让 DP 合成数据可无限分析共享，是相比脱敏的根本优势。</li>\n<li>两条实现路线：DP-SGD/DP-CTGAN（梯度加噪，通用但伤保真）与边际法（PrivBayes/MST/AIM，表格上常夺冠）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 取值靠场景权衡，且形式保证必须与成员推断等实证审计配合，证明与实测两条腿走路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"差分隐私合成","id":"差分隐私合成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"差分隐私的形式定义","id":"差分隐私的形式定义"},{"level":2,"text":"两条实现路线","id":"两条实现路线"},{"level":2,"text":"边际法：表格上的隐形冠军","id":"边际法-表格上的隐形冠军"},{"level":2,"text":"隐私预算怎么选","id":"隐私预算怎么选"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"表格数据合成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/tabular-synthesis"},"next":{"title":"评估保真与效用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/synthetic-data-generation/tabular-privacy/evaluation-fidelity-utility"}}